T65535
G150.1 F8000
M621 S65535

G150.3
M104 S0 ; turn off hotend
M400 ; wait all motion done
M140 S0 ; turn off bed
M104 S0 ; turn off hotend
M106 P2 S255 ; turn on remote part cooling fan

